{"record_id":"f5aa2eed9e01c896867d90e2bc4ea5a5","doc_path":"filter.md","chunk_id":"28cced32e3ed618241f345149b1f1fa3","heading_path":["Filter Coffee","Pour over"],"blocks":[{"lineage_id":"7f9ffbc107637b9713a9e09bb4533327","version_id":"45b9611349ef88482fd634a33408069d"},{"lineage_id":"b3492b2dc27f1dec2ab9d6294adf0028","version_id":"ce92b405de85da9bcf82f95b2bdf9846"},{"lineage_id":"086ed5e4a486fcfffcba05e5bc6c338e","version_id":"1e8a06f232fc955fe84257abcfe2a8fc"},{"lineage_id":"812db2269fdb246899d9589d0fc9b94e","version_id":"2c071c41b48a5e2ffedeaad24bdd4394"},{"lineage_id":"525be26945839638ba7dd6468a473af3","version_id":"0a9065af81877037dab4d62a7105e9a9"}],"lineage_ids":["7f9ffbc107637b9713a9e09bb4533327","b3492b2dc27f1dec2ab9d6294adf0028","086ed5e4a486fcfffcba05e5bc6c338e","812db2269fdb246899d9589d0fc9b94e","525be26945839638ba7dd6468a473af3"],"text":"Filter Coffee > Pour over\n\n## Pour over\n\n- Rinse the paper filter.\n\n- Bloom with twice the coffee weight in water for 30 seconds.\n\n- Pour in slow circles until the target weight.\n\nColombian lots from [[origins#Colombia]] are the default filter offering. The grinder setting is described in [[grinders]].","lexical_len":46}
