{"record_id":"8622f2dc6f95d8c95b682caf68efc49f","doc_path":"glossary.md","chunk_id":"8f7cb256bdb20a28c16547ca1a194ad1","heading_path":["Glossary"],"blocks":[{"lineage_id":"0efa64472202c2d77142203787309089","version_id":"31c451103b4da26383a3c081c542f479"},{"lineage_id":"a4b54ef54214708543ba32461c7245e2","version_id":"2d65bf3b0bb9c6cd7a1aafc730b4345a"},{"lineage_id":"89243155c63473406c366c44443f086f","version_id":"3cb70935467386c3af79d93baba74a30"},{"lineage_id":"3d768a5c89201ff82d09784ead3dc969","version_id":"da55c0f032e75c09999e8d627384dac4"},{"lineage_id":"6f4596082c7f4a96560a99c85c76f60e","version_id":"8e40d924b23ed024a9ec70b1abd37783"},{"lineage_id":"8f9472fd786e623025b60662175d5d01","version_id":"98380860c91d8b563f429f7f21f6df56"},{"lineage_id":"3fd1de74d25beba7fbcde785ac892015","version_id":"3051c2bc7b92cdb37b7f212345687a7b"},{"lineage_id":"082c4f7b097b987b31fca352286b6e5f","version_id":"da55c0f032e75c09999e8d627384dac4"}],"lineage_ids":["0efa64472202c2d77142203787309089","a4b54ef54214708543ba32461c7245e2","89243155c63473406c366c44443f086f","3d768a5c89201ff82d09784ead3dc969","6f4596082c7f4a96560a99c85c76f60e","8f9472fd786e623025b60662175d5d01","3fd1de74d25beba7fbcde785ac892015","082c4f7b097b987b31fca352286b6e5f"],"text":"Glossary\n\n# Glossary\n\n**First crack** is the audible popping when steam escapes the bean.\n\n**Charge** is the moment green coffee enters the hot drum.\n\n**Drop** is the moment roasted coffee leaves the drum.\n\n**Bloom** is the release of carbon dioxide when water first touches fresh grounds.\n\n**Chaff** is the papery skin that separates from the bean during roasting.\n\nNote: always check the drum temperature before charging.\n\n**Drop** is the moment roasted coffee leaves the drum.","lexical_len":74}
