{"record_id":"b92eeb3e14b28e06f6fa968c9b15ea2d","doc_path":"origins.md","chunk_id":"8741f16ecb0d09f44cd21bc162f9f811","heading_path":["Origins","Ethiopia"],"blocks":[{"lineage_id":"d74937e7345481424c8dd1094ff7c0ea","version_id":"9346b6c75afb5b3c735445c5c9a052da"},{"lineage_id":"4f27983352c768648a1b70ead03e8b21","version_id":"6dc6ed499cfcab64abf37b55c4c8da08"}],"lineage_ids":["d74937e7345481424c8dd1094ff7c0ea","4f27983352c768648a1b70ead03e8b21"],"text":"Origins > Ethiopia\n\n## Ethiopia\n\nGuji and Yirgacheffe lots are washed and show jasmine and bergamot. They are roasted light, see [[roasting]].","lexical_len":20}
{"record_id":"260e5b733b4c65065d44b9bda467e39c","doc_path":"roast-log.md","chunk_id":"a38f7786c420c06fd068a3942852b261","heading_path":["Roast Log"],"blocks":[{"lineage_id":"a7003050663632c970e6bb8f5628ef22","version_id":"61db1351561b2df061f0cd672e35fede"},{"lineage_id":"772aafd2ee6229225a248753ccad3b92","version_id":"c98a256035174ea9de4ecc2a58f55ea5"},{"lineage_id":"769770a8d7428b1e12ae9614516b1027","version_id":"170410bd6d3a656a296f08d5361eb06e"},{"lineage_id":"49414535cf37edd0490f096c4b8244ec","version_id":"75ba9fc1f7a5b5c19c61760b966dfc4c"},{"lineage_id":"b6d7f20845db7cac4ec61469eea0a9a9","version_id":"3051c2bc7b92cdb37b7f212345687a7b"}],"lineage_ids":["a7003050663632c970e6bb8f5628ef22","772aafd2ee6229225a248753ccad3b92","769770a8d7428b1e12ae9614516b1027","49414535cf37edd0490f096c4b8244ec","b6d7f20845db7cac4ec61469eea0a9a9"],"text":"Roast Log\n\n# Roast Log\n\nThe roast log records every batch so that profiles can be repeated. See [[roasting]] for the stage definitions.\n\n| Batch | Origin | Charge °C | Drop °C | Time | |---|---|---|---|---| | 101 | Ethiopia Guji | 200 | 205 | 9:40 | | 102 | Colombia Huila | 205 | 214 | 10:55 | | 103 | Brazil Cerrado | 210 | 222 | 11:30 |\n\nBatch 103 was slightly scorched; the charge temperature was lowered for the next Brazil roast.\n\nNote: always check the drum temperature before charging.","lexical_len":73}
{"record_id":"928f6fd35cf7face0f2801dc95c5596e","doc_path":"roasting.md","chunk_id":"1085aebb5a903c8508c6c4e11114510a","heading_path":["Roasting","Profiles"],"blocks":[{"lineage_id":"6703152c8524d55191e43523bcd76437","version_id":"389a10a27e7a0fdf851b1fa87468158d"},{"lineage_id":"adfee4046d6d7040924b11ab5e6b6be9","version_id":"78423145751e0de4333aec6ecbc0c308"},{"lineage_id":"bba694bad31c041bfdf6401205d94abe","version_id":"a3d537fbfe4e46a59c3014bc187451b4"},{"lineage_id":"cfdf3be561a7398df0d4f6fd1c898c9c","version_id":"3051c2bc7b92cdb37b7f212345687a7b"}],"lineage_ids":["6703152c8524d55191e43523bcd76437","adfee4046d6d7040924b11ab5e6b6be9","bba694bad31c041bfdf6401205d94abe","cfdf3be561a7398df0d4f6fd1c898c9c"],"text":"Roasting > Profiles\n\n## Profiles\n\nLight profiles keep floral notes and are used for [[origins#Ethiopia|Ethiopian lots]]. Dark profiles mute acidity and suit [[espresso]].\n\n> Never roast two origins in the same drum without a cleaning cycle.\n\nNote: always check the drum temperature before charging.","lexical_len":43}
{"record_id":"e8fef5300ec507c61b87241330fcfb05","doc_path":"roasting.md","chunk_id":"326e58dcb8319def7ccc49476d4aa3ea","heading_path":["Roasting"],"blocks":[{"lineage_id":"530e157c296aa53a7cac557cd6f50e6b","version_id":"8aae694f79bc1c928b5feae285565a57"},{"lineage_id":"e867631adaf5c9405da4462355c603ba","version_id":"4c54b41f0faf1006d4f3ebdebc54c904"}],"lineage_ids":["530e157c296aa53a7cac557cd6f50e6b","e867631adaf5c9405da4462355c603ba"],"text":"Roasting\n\n# Roasting\n\nRoasting turns green coffee into the brown beans we grind. The roaster controls heat, airflow and time, and every batch is logged in [[roast-log]].","lexical_len":27}
{"record_id":"e5f73540c4fd749573c49f897a35a009","doc_path":"roasting.md","chunk_id":"e2c5d012b6b8e18c006f6dd187ae1dc2","heading_path":["Roasting","Stages"],"blocks":[{"lineage_id":"8a5c4ac57dfa6428155dc63fe99f722f","version_id":"be98f109cfa0443702ec59fd68a88f79"},{"lineage_id":"057d8979d988330cce399b635bb14842","version_id":"74d36b715ac99a7d430da3e23330961c"},{"lineage_id":"e9167efac8ed691a4309006162504524","version_id":"07921ccf0eb318a9fccbb4c6347e9c1f"},{"lineage_id":"49e9d55dff4edbd5bd37aa54ab045f63","version_id":"3d63061a1a59e9a01975b11b36292cbd"}],"lineage_ids":["8a5c4ac57dfa6428155dc63fe99f722f","057d8979d988330cce399b635bb14842","e9167efac8ed691a4309006162504524","49e9d55dff4edbd5bd37aa54ab045f63"],"text":"Roasting > Stages\n\n## Stages\n\n1. Drying: moisture leaves the bean until it turns yellow.\n\n2. Maillard: sugars and amino acids react and aromas develop. - The bean expands and the color moves to tan. - Most body is built here.\n\n3. Development: the time after first crack that sets acidity.","lexical_len":47}
{"record_id":"f432cf69666a4fc3e4d9c4768f8b0e57","doc_path":"safety.md","chunk_id":"20efc4882e0c87c2312b5dbdcf379457","heading_path":["Safety"],"blocks":[{"lineage_id":"292188541d3a44d4fbef7e14e0636198","version_id":"a8a8bdbdf5c157a7e005ecc5ade19629"},{"lineage_id":"2e95f78c2aaf2c01a09f0083f8a0f295","version_id":"c326d856b270d64d20a875a633d46041"}],"lineage_ids":["292188541d3a44d4fbef7e14e0636198","2e95f78c2aaf2c01a09f0083f8a0f295"],"text":"Safety\n\n# Safety\n\nRoasting produces smoke and heat; the exhaust must be inspected according to [[maintenance#Monthly]].","lexical_len":16}
{"record_id":"33f15e7d1da976349b7a654900bd015d","doc_path":"safety.md","chunk_id":"21e976f4b4f5e5d4896bec0ac3b1069e","heading_path":["Safety","Burns"],"blocks":[{"lineage_id":"ae76c1e2e41be6a714f759e271a71d15","version_id":"4adc0205cce21f530155e533b6ce8067"},{"lineage_id":"d947bb460004de04a8e0fe56e4be28c7","version_id":"03a165438cfdf3b2c1df4dc6b41bbd9d"},{"lineage_id":"4dd0b3ced2e3466f03963048ddf5fb8f","version_id":"81ada11194c5b8efc74c4d8e90b0c3fc"},{"lineage_id":"1fb0c3f0a52234cfacd543e5fe3537ef","version_id":"7562548fac1032b1331fea01142958e2"},{"lineage_id":"25b61420a5d58c3edb4d742a09043b27","version_id":"2df4fe14d041a11c8cf5b0249625d1a6"}],"lineage_ids":["ae76c1e2e41be6a714f759e271a71d15","d947bb460004de04a8e0fe56e4be28c7","4dd0b3ced2e3466f03963048ddf5fb8f","1fb0c3f0a52234cfacd543e5fe3537ef","25b61420a5d58c3edb4d742a09043b27"],"text":"Safety > Burns\n\n## Burns\n\nThe drum and the steam wand are hot. Use gloves when emptying the cooling tray.\n\n<div class=\"warning\">Emergency number: 112</div>\n\n---\n\nLast reviewed by the technician.","lexical_len":30}
{"record_id":"1d01f343d1c01ef289609b623a54602f","doc_path":"safety.md","chunk_id":"c6679604ed7acea1382e8fb48fad73bd","heading_path":["Safety","Fire"],"blocks":[{"lineage_id":"b36be22e34fea8a53d5256e105afd133","version_id":"c6a462bd0692b1d3f192c5ecb6b1cb38"},{"lineage_id":"8a609fd9231756d186c7bcaf78497f20","version_id":"436944ba908df893fc27ea9f4303e186"}],"lineage_ids":["b36be22e34fea8a53d5256e105afd133","8a609fd9231756d186c7bcaf78497f20"],"text":"Safety > Fire\n\n## Fire\n\nChaff can ignite. Keep a class D extinguisher next to the roaster and never leave a batch unattended.","lexical_len":21}
{"record_id":"d07deaf401300c95fd4a8bf4eadeb207","doc_path":"staff.md","chunk_id":"22f6acd71ac5c2f8dfe202ac5bb20a9b","heading_path":["Staff","Training"],"blocks":[{"lineage_id":"21cb65ffb7b1887158f1e00eb687a130","version_id":"7a3f46eb788c1e540e215dad9c4fc507"},{"lineage_id":"a965a1162c262f61851009cf7102be04","version_id":"53c4f96b57d4da679c5ce561455005f6"}],"lineage_ids":["21cb65ffb7b1887158f1e00eb687a130","a965a1162c262f61851009cf7102be04"],"text":"Staff > Training\n\n## Training\n\nNew baristas learn [[espresso]] first and [[filter]] second. Roasters train on [[roasting]] for six weeks before running batches alone.","lexical_len":22}
{"record_id":"d9881e0c23b67f4b04c3240e011f1ae8","doc_path":"staff.md","chunk_id":"4e74bcbc1dfa0b04dbdf788bf83a62d9","heading_path":["Staff","Shifts"],"blocks":[{"lineage_id":"734eda49b32fb6c82b4cf96b4a24165f","version_id":"4ae1de09b6f4fe771ffdf563ee3f5111"},{"lineage_id":"cbd035fe38d39331bd6e72d84b2b3125","version_id":"844cd9066596ff41f983908197008e4e"}],"lineage_ids":["734eda49b32fb6c82b4cf96b4a24165f","cbd035fe38d39331bd6e72d84b2b3125"],"text":"Staff > Shifts\n\n## Shifts\n\nMorning shifts start at seven. The roaster runs batches on Tuesday and Friday.","lexical_len":16}
{"record_id":"dc7c985f99f423be7f86be3899baab63","doc_path":"staff.md","chunk_id":"e6fe797e845065007784a39af423bdc1","heading_path":["Staff"],"blocks":[{"lineage_id":"37bba9069bab1086bcf1a5d6b2bc6f79","version_id":"b9fe02e3a0803473551a15f099edd947"},{"lineage_id":"7dc9de0d3bc7da51ce1558c1dcc4cfa3","version_id":"e4b60834fd3ebae1125ad460d83b301a"}],"lineage_ids":["37bba9069bab1086bcf1a5d6b2bc6f79","7dc9de0d3bc7da51ce1558c1dcc4cfa3"],"text":"Staff\n\n# Staff\n\nThe roastery has three roles: barista, roaster and technician.","lexical_len":11}
